From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DoomGuy41 <DoomGuy41@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:36:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] hwui: cap the reported GL version at 2.0

Added while GL went through the emulator GLES 2 encoder (bring-up). Kept with the native
Adreno driver: the released build is tested with ES 2.0 behaviour in hwui.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 libs/hwui/Extensions.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libs/hwui/Extensions.cpp b/libs/hwui/Extensions.cpp
index 84e7e650..94a5d701 100644
--- a/libs/hwui/Extensions.cpp
+++ b/libs/hwui/Extensions.cpp
@@ -91,6 +91,11 @@ Extensions::Extensions(): Singleton<Extensions>() {
         mVersionMajor = 2;
         mVersionMinor = 0;
     }
+    // Pixel 2 XL: cap at ES 2.0 (added when GL went through the GLES2-only emulator encoder; kept)
+    if (mVersionMajor > 2) {
+        mVersionMajor = 2;
+        mVersionMinor = 0;
+    }
 }
 
 Extensions::~Extensions() {
